{"content":[{"c":["WOOL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Important commodity of the ancient Near East. King Mesha of Moab, a sheep breeder, annually sent the wool of 100,000 rams as tribute to King Ahab of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.3.4","r":"2Kgs.3.4","rawR":"2Kgs.3.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.3.4","value":"2Kgs.3.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 3:4"},"), and the people of Damascus traded wool with Tyre’s merchants (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.27.18","r":"Ezek.27.18","rawR":"Ezek.27.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.27.18","value":"Ezek.27.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 27:18"},"). Woolen garments were commonly worn by the Israelites (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.13.47-59","r":"Lev.13.47-59","rawR":"Lev.13.47-59","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.13.47-59","value":"Lev.13.47-59"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 13:47-59"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.51.8","r":"Isa.51.8","rawR":"Isa.51.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.51.8","value":"Isa.51.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 51:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Hos.2.5,9","r":"Hos.2.5,9","rawR":"Hos.2.5,9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.2.5,9","value":"Hos.2.5,9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hos 2:5, 9"},"), though woolen garments mingled with linen fabric were forbidden (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.22.11","r":"Deut.22.11","rawR":"Deut.22.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.22.11","value":"Deut.22.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 22:11"},"). In fact, wearing wool was prohibited entirely for Israelite priests serving in the sanctuary’s inner court (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.44.17","r":"Ezek.44.17","rawR":"Ezek.44.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.44.17","value":"Ezek.44.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 44:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Wool is sometimes a biblical symbol for whiteness and purity, it is a simile for redemption (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.1.18","r":"Isa.1.18","rawR":"Isa.1.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.1.18","value":"Isa.1.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 1:18"},"), for the hair of the Ancient of Days (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.7.9","r":"Dan.7.9","rawR":"Dan.7.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.7.9","value":"Dan.7.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 7:9"},"), and for the hair and head of the Son of Man (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.1.14","r":"Rev.1.14","rawR":"Rev.1.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.1.14","value":"Rev.1.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 1:14"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Cloth and Cloth Manufacturing"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Wool","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 3:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.3.4","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.3.4","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.3.4"},{"anchorText":"Ez 27:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.27.18","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.27.18","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.27.18"},{"anchorText":"Lv 13:47-59","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.13.47-59","rawQueryValue":"Lev.13.47-59","sourceRefExact":"Lev.13.47-59"},{"anchorText":"Is 51:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.51.8","rawQueryValue":"Isa.51.8","sourceRefExact":"Isa.51.8"},{"anchorText":"Hos 2:5, 9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.2.5,9","rawQueryValue":"Hos.2.5,9","sourceRefExact":"Hos.2.5,9"},{"anchorText":"Dt 22:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.22.11","rawQueryValue":"Deut.22.11","sourceRefExact":"Deut.22.11"},{"anchorText":"Ez 44:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.44.17","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.44.17","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.44.17"},{"anchorText":"Is 1:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.1.18","rawQueryValue":"Isa.1.18","sourceRefExact":"Isa.1.18"},{"anchorText":"Dn 7:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.7.9","rawQueryValue":"Dan.7.9","sourceRefExact":"Dan.7.9"},{"anchorText":"Rv 1:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.1.14","rawQueryValue":"Rev.1.14","sourceRefExact":"Rev.1.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"108472766252a949062cb050b9f95eb730274c49da122ab71d8eb1838b2fa659","sourceItemName":"Wool","sourceItemOrder":65,"sourceMember":"Articles/W.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Wool","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Wool","title":"Wool","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}